  "display_title": "Your Majesty, That's Enough",
  "description": "Sharan, a slave of the Valdek Empire, longs for nothing more than to buy her freedom and return to her homeland. But after a fearsome encounter with the cursed emperor, Julian Vadenberg, she ends up as his personal maid! Now, she has the chance to earn her freedom by using her magic to cure Julian of his curse... if not for the fact that she's surrounded by enemies on all sides at the palace. With such perilous prospects, can she survive long enough to heal the emperor and finally break free?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
